<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00240/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>该项目是是一把工作用椅。使用该项目工作效率会逐渐提升，但在工作完成后将昏睡4.05倍的使用时间<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>███办公室<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被保存在Site-CN-█低危异常收容柜内<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong></p>
<blockquote>
<p>当我用完才知道这个██的工作椅下面写着：时间贷，特惠就收1%的利息。真██。——特工██</p>
</blockquote>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00240" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00240" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00240-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dead-wood240" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6243991); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6243991&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608126725" alt="Dead wood240" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6243991)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dead-wood240" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6243991); return false;">Dead wood240</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1591430833 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">06 Jun 2020 08:07</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00398/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一支原产于比利时的FN FNC突击步枪，只有在弹匣井内插有巧克力块时才能射出子弹。若插入正常弹匣，则项目只会射出5.56×45mm子弹形状的巧克力。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>武警部队特种警察大队██仓库<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>收容于Site-CN-██异常武器收容单元<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>射出的巧克力吃起来特别甜。</em>——Dr. Kleiner</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00398" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00398" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00398-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kayo-kesr-aquas" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5232386); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5232386&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608126725" alt="Kayo_Kesr_Aquas" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5232386)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kayo-kesr-aquas" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5232386); return false;">Kayo_Kesr_Aquas</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1600577702 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">20 Sep 2020 04:55</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00434/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一把四位转轮密码挂锁，当使用者设定密码后，密码将在[数据删除]天后失效，穷举法证明此时该锁不存在正确的密码。商标显示该锁为“OldC锁具&amp;劣质产品®联名款”<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/10/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>研究员ENC的寝室<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被研究员ENC以[数据删除]牛顿的力量强行扭开而损坏<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>淦！老子的零食，医药包和[数据删除]都锁在里面呢！——研究员ENC</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;研究员ENC收到的来信，推测为OldC锁具公司发送</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;点击隐藏</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p><strong>很抱歉给您带来了不好的用户体验</strong><br />
我们的本意是制造一款定期更换密码的门锁，结果他们搞砸了</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00434" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00434" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00434-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/edwardnewtchen" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6273721); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6273721&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608126725" alt="EdwardNewtChen" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6273721)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/edwardnewtchen" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6273721); return false;">EdwardNewtChen</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1602069146 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">07 Oct 2020 11:12</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00015/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一张Site-CN-02全体在任研究员的集体合影，其中出现了多名拍摄时已殉职的研究员。需要注意的是，尽管该合影当时曾印制多份并发配给全体参与拍摄的研究员手中，但只有研究员Misaki所持有的这份出现该异常。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>研究员Misaki的私人住宅内<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>由研究员Misaki私人所持有<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>怎么搞的，针对我是吧，又不是我害死你们的</em>——研究员Misaki</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00015" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00015" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00015-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/miku1314" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4546338); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4546338&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608126725" alt="miku1314" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4546338)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/miku1314" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4546338); return false;">miku1314</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1585806968 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">02 Apr 2020 05:56</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00221/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一个████牌头戴式耳机，在被人用来听歌时，使用者会不自觉地唱出正在听的歌<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Dr.pigeon的办公室<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被放置于Site-██低价值异常物品收容室中<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>I want something just like this～Oh, I want something just like this～</em>——正在使用项目听歌的Dr.pigeon<br />
<em>Oh,I want something just he stop！</em>——被Dr.pigeon的歌声折磨到崩溃的特工fan</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00221" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00221" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00221-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6306406&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608126725" alt="ScorpionidaSlaughter" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6306406)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;">ScorpionidaSlaughter</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1590676061 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">28 May 2020 14:27</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00132/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一件黑色卫衣，当被放置在椅背上时会缓慢在椅背上堆叠新的衣服，新产生的个体不具有异常性质。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site-CN-101员工Fred的宿舍<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>存放在Site-CN-101的低价值物品保险柜。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>你确定不是仅仅因为你懒而已？——GuAo</em></p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00132" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00132" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00132-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/i-am-guao" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5948673); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5948673&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608126725" alt="I am GuAo" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5948673)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/i-am-guao" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5948673); return false;">I am GuAo</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1588219873 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">30 Apr 2020 04:11</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00450/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一台手机，型号未知，系统未知，当有人在使用它超过2小时之后，眼睛会剧烈疼痛，并且此现象会持续20秒，之后使用者的视力会成为5.0，并且永远不会改变。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>██省██市██街<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>魏██研究员的抽屉里<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>谁██的能告诉我，为啥我视力是5.2现在却成了5.0了？！姓魏的我要杀了你啊！<br />
-██博士</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00450" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00450" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00450-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sertay" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6605732); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6605732&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608126725" alt="sertay" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6605732)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sertay" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6605732); return false;">sertay</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1603343321 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">22 Oct 2020 05:08</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00443/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一杯███牌橙汁，杯身呈现透明状态，其上用棕色小字印着“保护环境，举手之劳”的字样。任何试图丢弃该项目的个体都无法将其投入正确分类的垃圾桶中。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/10/16<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>于“站点环保日”被发现于Site-CN-██的不可回收垃圾桶中。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>放置于PK博士的垃圾袋中<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>我抗议，本人是名副其实的环保之星，之前将垃圾扔错垃圾桶纯粹是他人陷害，建议进行调查。——PK博士</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00443" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00443" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00443-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pknoland" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3420430); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3420430&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608126725" alt="PKNOLAND" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3420430)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pknoland" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3420430); return false;">PKNOLAND</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1602863693 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">16 Oct 2020 15:54</span></p>
</div>
